#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:164
msgid ""
"At this point, we need to create three automation Tasks. One will set the"
" Apache config file we just created, another will be a Bash script Task "
"to actually install and configure SuiteCRM on the box, and the third will"
" be another Bash script Task which will restart the Apache service."
msgstr ""
"At this point, we need to create three automation Tasks. One will set the "
