msgid ""
"SuiteCRM is now ready for its initial setup. In a web browser, go to "
"`http://<YOUR_INSTANCE_IP>/install.php`. You should see the license "
"agreement page and can proceed with the setup steps. SuiteCRM is now up "
"and running. Additional instances of SuiteCRM can be stood up in the "
"future with just a few clicks!"
msgstr ""
"SuiteCRM is now ready for its initial setup. In a web browser, go to "
"`http://<YOUR_INSTANCE_IP>/install.php`. You should see the license "
"agreement page y can proceed con the setup steps. SuiteCRM is now up y "
"running. Additional instances of SuiteCRM puede ser stood up in the future "
"con just a few clicks!"

